steps.text:
The <b>DiamondView</b> lights the stone with very short UV and photographs the glow. Each growth mode draws different patterns:
• <b>natural</b> diamond shows wavy growth lines, in irregular layers;
• <b>HPHT</b> diamond shows cross-shaped or dial-shaped patterns;
• <b>CVD</b> diamond shows parallel, fine and regular layers.
